  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0021_a051d2cd415a.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 297px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now defining&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;the only possible solution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
